shortdesc Display trees in the style of windows explorer
relocated 1
longdesc This package is designed to emulate the way windows explorer
longdesc displays directory and file trees, with the root at top left,
longdesc and each level of subtree displaying one step in to the right.
longdesc The macros work equally well with Plain TeX and with LaTeX.
